    <summary>Free 0-100 PC health score, plain-English fixes, upgrade advice &amp; PDF reports.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Check why a Windows PC is slow or running hot in seconds — with a clear 0-100 health score, plain-English fixes, honest upgrade advice, live temperature graphs, and shareable reports.

One Clear 0-100 Health Score: Instantly see how healthy your PC is across cooling, storage, memory, and overall condition — without digging through confusing Windows menus. Plain-English Fixes Ranked by Priority: Every issue tells you what it means, why it matters, and exactly what to do next — with zero technical jargon. Honest Upgrade Advice: Tells you whether adding more RAM, a bigger drive, or a new graphics card will actually help — and when not to waste your money. Live Performance & Temperature Graphs: Watch real-time CPU, graphics, memory, and drive temperature charts with session lows and highs (and never guesses missing sensors).

Licensing: This package installs the Free edition of RigCheck for Windows 10 & 11 (64-bit) (0-100 health score, plain-English fixes, honest upgrade advice, live temperature graphs, 100+ searchable specs, and PDF/Word/RTF reports — free for personal or commercial use, no licence key required). Need self-checking burn-in stress tests, Detective Mode, and branded workshop PDF certificates? See RigCheck Pro (£9.99 one-time purchase, 1 year of free updates included, keeps working forever, available as `rigcheckpro` or at https://razorlinestudios.co.uk/app.php?slug=rigcheckpro).]]></description>
